\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Ore-acle UI response to the query ``What is an enchantment table and how can I get one?'' The system retrieves the relevant wiki chunks and renders the crafting recipe grid (Book, two Diamonds, four Obsidian) inline within the response, alongside inline citations. This demonstrates the system's multimodal grounding: structured recipe data extracted from wiki CSS grids is presented visually rather than as raw text.}}{6}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ui_crafting}{{5}{6}{Ore-acle UI response to the query ``What is an enchantment table and how can I get one?'' The system retrieves the relevant wiki chunks and renders the crafting recipe grid (Book, two Diamonds, four Obsidian) inline within the response, alongside inline citations. This demonstrates the system's multimodal grounding: structured recipe data extracted from wiki CSS grids is presented visually rather than as raw text}{figure.caption.5}{}}
